{"id":"C29a03110e5c943779ce2","zh":"轨道不平顺谱","en":"track irregularity power spectrum density","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"轨道不平顺随空间频率或波长变化的统计谱表示。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C29a03110e5c943779ce2","zh":"轨道不平顺谱","en":"track irregularity power spectrum density","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"H83fda0d509165183260d","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · 陈宪麦等（2016）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D189e7186e8b30c17a338","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"轨道不平顺谱"},{"id":"Dd06a19d5700c78a57a89","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"track irregularity power spectrum density"}],"sources":{"P106":{"id":"P106","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱研究","authors":"陈宪麦,徐磊,王卫东,贺天龙,张向民,向尚,陈文韬","year":"2016","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2016.09.005","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-research-on-track-irregularity-power-spectrum-density-of-qinghai-tibet-railway"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S3b3145937ad6b901ce5c","source_id":"P106","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"目前,对于青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱的系统研究还较少,轨道不平顺谱(track irregularity power spectrum density,PSD) 既是轮轨系统之激励输入,也是线路基础结构几何状态的重要表征,在车辆-轨道耦合动力学分析与评估、机车车辆悬挂参数及线桥隧设计中十分重要。","citations":[{"source_id":"P106","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sb93c0ff596943fd2e14d","source_id":"P106","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"基于此,本文利用较为完备的青藏铁路轨道不平顺实测数据,以概率论为基础,对青藏铁路的轨道不平顺谱特征,谱密度分布概型、估计参数及假设检验, 轨道不平顺谱拟合,以及不同概率水平下的谱密度反演方法等问题做了较为系统的研究。","citations":[{"source_id":"P106","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C30ca8725e97464966f50","target_concept_id":"C30ca8725e97464966f50","target_zh":"车辆-轨道耦合动力学","target_en":"vehicle-track coupling dynamics","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cfb9028eaecb91cd62d7f","target_concept_id":"Cfb9028eaecb91cd62d7f","target_zh":"基础结构","target_en":"railway infrastructure","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C0138e29ffa25af6acb7f","target_concept_id":"